    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your heritage is a mixed one, with a long line that merges families of other lineages and heritages. You gain the ability to select any sapien ancestry feat regardless of lineage or heritage requirements.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special:</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> If you are using the Golarion Ancestries rule, you can pick one of the following: Human, Elf or Dwarf; you can select any ancestry feats from the selected ancestry (at your GM’s discretion).</span></p>"
